            <cap:headline>STAY INFORMED - Wongawallan (near Oxenford) - fire as at 2:29pm Saturday, 19 September 2026</cap:headline>
            <cap:description>*** There is more than one warning for this area. To see all current warnings, visit the Qld Fire website ***

A fire is burning off Wongawallan Drive. It is moving towards Ruffles Road. This fire could burn for days.

Stay informed because the situation could change.</cap:description>
            <cap:instruction>- Check for warning updates often and listen to your local radio station.

- Decide what you will do if the bushfire gets closer.

- If the smoke is thick where you are, stay inside and close windows and doors.

- If you need medication to help you breathe keep it close. Smoke can make it hard to breathe.

- Do not fly drones around the fire as they affect firefighting.

- If you are in danger, call Triple Zero (000) now.
